// endpoint_kill_session.proto — KillSession: END the session and everything
// live in it — the turn if one is open and EVERY live task, whichever turn
// spawned it. Stops the keep-alive cadence, ends the vendor query, lets every
// open stream conclude with a terminal frame, and exits. REFUSES while
// anything is live unless forced: the daemon is the one decider of what dies.
//
// NOT the same as a consumer closing its Watch streams: that ends nothing.

